emories. Revisit past scenes and gauge your photographic prowess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557630/extras/466e22150a34a283f928cda466145a4a.poster.avif?t=1751608564\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557630/extras/466e22150a34a283f928cda466145a4a.webm?t=1751608564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557630/extras/466e22150a34a283f928cda466145a4a.mp4?t=1751608564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER HIDDEN TREASURES THROUGH YOUR LENS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's hundreds of things for you to find! What do you want to take a photo of? Adorable fauna, exquisite flora, varied landscapes, sparkling gems, peculiar townsfolk, or enigmatic clues. Your camera, your universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557630/extras/633b47b38fbf8982c3917a317fd2b071.poster.avif?t=1751608564\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557630/extras/633b47b38fbf8982c3917a317fd2b071.webm?t=1751608564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2557630/extras/633b47b38fbf8982c3917a317fd2b071.mp4?t=1751608564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
